# Assets

Copy these from the shared branding package (never recreate or recolour them, Law 2):

- `mark.svg`: the green V glyph (favicon, rail, avatar). 30px in the sidebar, 20px minimum.
- `logo-invinsense.svg` and `logo-invinsense-white.svg`: wordmark for light and dark themes.
- `infopercept.png`: corporate mark, login footer only.
- 44x44 product icon for __PRODUCT_NAME__ in the __FAMILY_NAME__ family tones (36x36 live area, 4px clear space). Register it in the launcher `catalog.js`.
- `login-illustration.json`: animated isometric Lottie scene for the login left panel (under 200 KB, family two tones).
